{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmn1KdvysSH8PAkd57GL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd pick **option B (ב. אותו סיפור בשורות)**, even though the designers marked A as **מומלץ**. The rows put each label right next to its number, so it reads top to bottom like a payslip: **הפקדתם 18,000 ₪**, **המעסיק הוסיף +54,000 ₪**, and so on. In A, I had to look back and forth between the tall bars and the labels under them.\n\n### 1. My answer and how sure I am\nI'd open a keren hishtalmut, or keep the one I have, and not take the money out before year 6. I'm about 80% sure.\n\nWhat decided it for me is **המעסיק הוסיף +54,000 ₪** next to **הפקדתם 18,000 ₪**. I put in 300 a month and my boss puts in 900. My own S&P 500 account never gets that extra 900. The year 6 chart settled the timing: **המס לקח 0 ₪** and **נשאר בידיים 98,738 ₪**, compared with 66,513 ₪ if I take it out at year 5.\n\nThe missing 20% is because of the note **\"האחוזים האמיתיים כתובים בהסכם העבודה\"**. I don't know if my job even offers this, or at what percentages.\n\n### 2. What I actually used\n- The example line about salary and percentages (**\"שכר ברוטו 12,000 ₪ בחודש\"**, **\"אתם 2.5% והמעסיק 7.5%\"**), to check that it's someone like me.\n- The big bars in the year 5 chart and the year 6 chart.\n- The sentence under the chart: **\"אם מושכים עכשיו ושמים את הכסף בחשבון ניירות ערך עד שנה 6: 68,837 ₪, כלומר 15,141 ₪ פחות מאשר לחכות\"**.\n- The two headings on the small year bars: **\"לפני 6 שנים: מס\"** in pink and **\"מ-6 שנים: פטור ממס\"**.\n\n### 3. Block by block\n- **The title and the line under it**: I skimmed them. **\"אפשר לגרור את השנים\"** told me I could move the years, but I'm only looking at pictures.\n- **\"מה היה:\" with the small old chart**: I skipped it. It's about an older version and means nothing to me. The words **\"חלקים שמרחפים\"** and **\"משפט על כל שקל\"** were noise.\n- **The example paragraph**: I used the first half (salary, 2.5%/7.5%, **\"תשואה 7% בשנה\"**). I skipped the second half: **\"מיטב השתלמות עוקב מדד S&P500 (13245)\"**, **\"ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D) (5139282)\"**, Pepper and the 0.54%. Those are names and numbers I can't do anything with. **\"עד תקרה בחוק\"** confused me a little.\n- **א. הערימה גדלה, the intro text**: I skimmed it. **\"לפני שנה 6 היא ההשוואה\"** helped a bit.\n- **The שכירים / עצמאים tabs**: I glanced at them. I'm salaried and it was already selected.\n- **The year 5 chart**: I used it, and it's the main thing I used. The **\"אם מחכים לשנה 6 בלי להפקיד עוד 83,978 ₪\"** dashed box was the strongest push to wait.\n- **The line about \"19 המסלולים\"**: I skipped it. **\"66,280 ₪ בדמי ניהול של 0.7% עד 67,028 ₪ בדמי ניהול של 0.19%\"** is about choosing between accounts, and I'm not at that stage.\n- **\"אותו ציור שנה אחת אחר כך\"**: I used it to confirm that tax goes to 0 at year 6. I liked **\"אין על מה לחכות\"**.\n- **ב. אותו סיפור בשורות**: I used it. It's the same numbers, just easier for me to read.\n\n### 4. Charts: what I looked at and what I ignored\n- **I looked at:**\n  - the white bar **נשאר בידיים**\n  - yellow for the employer and grey for my money\n  - teal for the profit\n  - the pink striped part, which I understood as tax\n  - the dashed **אם מחכים** box\n  - the circled year number (5 or 6)\n- **I ignored:**\n  - the dark olive bars inside **התשואה הוסיפה** and **המס לקח**. I didn't get why the yellow suddenly turns brown.\n  - the dotted connector lines\n  - the year numbers 7–12 on the small chart. I only looked at the split at 6.\n  - the small grey note **\"הגובה נמתח בכל שנה…\"**\n- **I guessed:** nothing tells me what each colour means. I worked it out by matching the colours to the labels.\n\n### 5. What I didn't understand\n- Why the tax at year 5 is so big (−13,974 ₪) and what it's charged on: my money, my boss's money, or only the profit?\n- **\"עד תקרה בחוק\"**: what is the limit?\n- **\"מסלול\"**, **\"מחקה\"**, **\"(4D)\"**, and the long numbers in brackets.\n- **\"אחרי דמי ניהול\"**: I roughly get it, but I don't know how much they took.\n\n### 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n- The comparison I actually came for: my 300 a month in a keren versus the same 300 a month in my own S&P 500 account. The subtitle even says **\"ובלי חשבון ניירות ערך לצד הקרן של שכירים\"**, so it was taken out.\n- Would my boss pay me the 900 as salary instead if I don't join?\n- After year 6, do I have to take the money out, or can it keep growing?\n- What happens if I change jobs before year 6?\n- How do I find out if I have one, and how do I open one?\n\n### 7. If half the page had to go\nIn this order:\n1. The **\"מה היה:\"** block with the old chart.\n2. The fund names, track numbers and Pepper line in the example paragraph.\n3. The **\"בין 19 המסלולים…\"** line.\n4. One of the two chart options (A for me).\n\nI'd keep the year 5 and year 6 charts, and the sentence about **\"15,141 ₪ פחות מאשר לחכות\"**."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7229,"cache_read_input_tokens":3698,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7229},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04aedb5b-2d86-4bab-96f7-4c6707c537ac","uuid":"9ddc06ae-6d82-41ba-9423-299df42d045c","timestamp":"2026-11-06T13:46:51.273Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmn1KQXZxyRYCo7nFJyL"}
